cff-version: 1.2.0
title: VanDAQ
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/CalMAPLab/VanDAQ"
url: "https://github.com/CalMAPLab/VanDAQ"
abstract: >-
  VanDAQ is an open-source scientific data-acquisition system for mobile or
  fixed platforms carrying multiple atmospheric and environmental instruments.
  It normalizes heterogeneous instrument outputs, writes them to PostgreSQL,
  packages submissions for central aggregation, and provides Dash-based
  diagnostic dashboards with alarm handling and remote instrument control.
keywords:
  - data acquisition
  - atmospheric measurements
  - PostgreSQL
  - scientific software
